      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Grateful that our President and the other attendees at the White House Correspondents\u2019 Dinner are safe after tonight\u2019s shooting. Praying for the recovery of the officer who was shot. Political violence is un-American &amp; it needs to end.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2048232481405747445",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-26T02:47:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Met the aunt of one of my fellow ball boys growing up in Cincinnati. Love moments like these.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2048199604001468728",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-26T00:36:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Back the blue. Grateful for the men &amp; women who risk their lives every day to keep us safe in Ohio.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2048053218425569340",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T14:55:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Spawning the next generation of nuclear energy will go down in history as one of the greatest achievements of the Trump administration.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047859668740165779",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T02:06:07+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Energy dominance is the ballgame.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047859477517664313",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T02:05:21+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A friend sent this to me from the Greene County Republican club last night. Thank you, @timoharaforohio! A great Ohioan, patriot, and friend. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047710075469676889",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T16:11:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Back in 2024 when Charlie &amp; I visited campuses, the crazy questions we got came from the woke left, but now there\u2019s a new trend emerging. This was the last question I got at OSU this week (and it wasn\u2019t the only one like it).\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047670412126179723",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T13:34:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Grabbed pancakes with a group of guys who go to church every week &amp; get together for breakfast every Wednesday morning to talk about faith. Turns out they were a lot wiser than most of the politicians I meet.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047384800009519122",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T18:39:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I asked a retired math teacher what we can do to fix education in Ohio &amp; here\u2019s what she said. My opponents think it\u2019s controversial. Sounds like common sense to me.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047357454309351740",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T16:50:29+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ambition &amp; curiosity. A belief in American exceptionalism. That\u2019s what we\u2019re going to revive through the economic &amp; educational boom coming to Ohio next year.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047345273534562604",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T16:02:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A general rule of thumb: every day Americans spend their own money more effectively than the government does for them. That\u2019s why we\u2019re going to slash income taxes &amp; property taxes next year in Ohio.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047329322659451009",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T14:58:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s the truth.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047132362044018733",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T01:56:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Yes, I got the (now boringly standard) question about U.S. aid to Israel. Here\u2019s what I said.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047113154790879483",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T00:39:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Packed the house last night. Thank you Ohio State &amp; Turning Point.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2047018005721158131",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T18:21:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ohio led the first Industrial Revolution &amp; we can lead the next one. We\u2019re going to shape the future, instead of viewing ourselves as victims of it.\n\n\nFOX & Friends (@foxandfriends)\n\nPURPOSE OVER PANIC: @VivekGRamaswamy is calling for a productivity powerhouse shift, urging Americans to master the machine rather than fear the future of AI.\n\n\"The more you view yourself as a VICTIM, the more likely you are to be a victim.\"\n\n\"I think that's just a true life lesson. I think it's true about how w",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2046963091594727504",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T14:43:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s Ohio\u2019s turn to lead the way.\n\n\nFOX & Friends (@foxandfriends)\n\nOHIO OVERHAUL: @VivekGRamaswamy is betting on a Buckeye State boom that would put the Republican Party\u2019s Southern strongholds in the rearview mirror.\n\n\"By the time I'm done, give me a couple years, Texas and Florida will be looking up to Ohio rather than the other way around.\"\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/foxandfriends/status/2046908031103803901#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2046962714153505005",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T14:41:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Enjoyed some incredible cornmeal pancakes at Tee Jaye\u2019s Country Place! Now time to hit the gym. \ud83d\ude05",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2046942690219090233",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T13:22:22+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\nFOX & Friends (@foxandfriends)\n\nVIVEK RAMASWAMY: \"Some young people are skeptical of that American dream. To me, how can I tell them I know that American Dream exists? I know it exists because I have lived it in this state.\"\n\n\"My parents came halfway around the world, half a century ago to Cincinnati, Ohio, with nothing to their name. In a single generation, I have founded multi-billion dollar companies, became the youngest person to run for president as a Republican.\"\n\n\"Now hopefully lea",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2046930305659830734",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T12:33:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
