      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Packed house tonight at Ohio State, grateful for the energy. This is just the beginning. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
